  "findings": [
    {
      "severity": "info",
      "claim": "All 163 declared source hashes match before and after this audit. The 121 original assigned bindings, 150 original independent-audit bindings and all 152 original freeze bindings remain unchanged and are within the declared union.",
      "evidence": "receipts/I12-review-lifecycle-addendum-audit-inputs.v1.json; receipts/I12-native-author-inputs.v2.json; reports/I12-native-independent-prelaunch-review.v2.json; reports/I12-native-independent-prelaunch.v2.json; freeze-I12-native.v2.json; independent SHA256 comparisons."
    },
    {
      "severity": "info",
      "claim": "The full original six-case, five-arm scope is preserved: 114 generation/D roles, 84 raw roles, 30 D roles and 24 dual raw/post reviews. Original reads, cards, schemas, matrix denominators, pilot 46/48 and confirmation 92/96 call allocations, six preparation calls and separate one completion audit allocation remain unchanged. This is the assigned sixth preparation audit, not a completion audit.",
      "evidence": "composition-schedule.draft.json:I12; composition-assessment.draft.json:I12; composition-i12-schedule.draft-v2.json; composition-i12-reviews.draft-v2.json; contracts/I12-native-preparation-contract.v2.json; receipts/I12-native-preparation-budget.v1.json; tools/composition_i12_runtime_v2.py:215-270; independent validate_schedule and literal prompt comparisons."
    },
    {
      "severity": "info",
      "claim": "Both original actual saved native capacity outputs remain structurally valid at raw 730 and post 855 rows. Their output, prompt, wrapper, core, private-map, schedule and preparation-snapshot hashes match; their bound start/FINAL witnesses and original independent prelaunch witnesses remain structurally valid and separate. The raw 21883-word output retains its charged 1883-word overage; post saved words remain 13813. These are structure/size results only.",
      "evidence": "reports/I12-maximal-native-raw-capacity-validation.v2.json; reports/I12-maximal-native-post-capacity-validation.v2.json; reviews/composition-capacity/I12-maximal-raw-v2.json; reviews/composition-capacity/I12-maximal-post-v2.json; fixtures/composition-i12-maximal-inputs.v2.json; reports/I12-native-independent-prelaunch.v2.json; independent validate_review, start_valid, final_valid and canonical source-snapshot checks."
    },
    {
      "severity": "info",
      "claim": "The pure review adapter requires an original scheduled review, distinct generation dependencies, every dependency terminal, exact private-map hash, complete dependency/unit set coverage, matching packet dispositions and the original assigned opaque reviewer before delegating. Valid, invalid, missing and skipped remain distinct. It changes only the inappropriate successful-generation prerequisite for preparing a failure assessment.",
      "evidence": "tools/composition_i12_review_lifecycle_addendum_v1.py:13-36; tools/test_composition_i12_review_lifecycle_addendum_v1.py:test_02 through test_09 and test_16; independent actual H-P packet/map reconstruction with 14 raw dependencies and 14 units."
    },
    {
      "severity": "info",
      "claim": "All literal generation and raw/post reviewer templates equal the original runtime-generated text. The successful-source regression compares the entire preparation result, including the prompt text and hash, with the original planner. Core and extension schemas, rubric, matrix construction, wrapper contents, raw carry, family treatment and scalar policy are unchanged; the adapter performs no scoring or semantic reinterpretation.",
      "evidence": "prompts/composition-i12-draft-v2/*.txt as exactly enumerated in source_bindings; tools/composition_i12_runtime_v2.py:687-728; tools/composition_i12_review_lifecycle_addendum_v1.py:33-36; tools/test_composition_i12_review_lifecycle_addendum_v1.py:test_01_successful_dependencies_keep_exact_original_prompt; independent literal-role and literal-review comparisons."
    },
    {
      "severity": "info",
      "claim": "Original actual H-P source history remains one missing, one invalid, two valid and fifteen skipped generation roles. G0802/G0803 saved body hashes and valid results match their original joins. G0804 saved bytes reproduce the two original source-reference errors and remain invalid. G0801 keeps a null output hash and the original missing-output error; skipped roles retain their original explicit causes and null semantic assessment in the bound history. The diagnostic packet retains all 14 planned raw units and marks both invalid G0804 raw-card obligations with null_semantics=true.",
      "evidence": "receipts/I12-review-guard-actual-input-history.v1.json; outputs/composition-i12/G0802.json; outputs/composition-i12/G0803.json; outputs/composition-i12/G0804.json; reports/I12-review-lifecycle-addendum-code-check.v1.json:diagnostic_packet,actual_source_states; independent state_from_events, validate_generation and exact saved-body hash checks."
    },
    {
      "severity": "info",
      "claim": "The proposed diagnostic packet, private map and preparation receipt reproduce exactly in memory, including 164 obligations and assigned reviewer V-c6b5f1c488cd579255b9. The original planner reproduces skipped while the adapter returns job_prepared without mutating inputs. The bound source-history snapshot contains generation events only, and the parent diagnostic report records zero review/trial events and zero score/native credit. Its diagnostic job_prepared object is not a lifecycle event in that declared snapshot.",
      "evidence": "reports/I12-review-lifecycle-addendum-code-check.v1.json:original_guard_reproduction,proposed_guard_preparation,diagnostic_packet,diagnostic_map,review_or_trial_events_created; receipts/I12-review-guard-actual-input-history.v1.json; independent pure reconstruction and before/after deep-equality checks. No undeclared live event log was read."
    },
    {
      "severity": "info",
      "claim": "Original admission, phase readiness, first preparation/save, post-before-actual-dual-raw-lock, actual fresh native start, parent-observed FINAL and zero-retry guards remain delegated to the unchanged v2 runtime. The correction cannot admit a generation role, bypass pending/running dependencies, accept stale packet dispositions, reuse an existing output/prompt or prepare an already-prepared review.",
      "evidence": "tools/composition_i12_runtime_v2.py:841-901,914-961,1165-1207; tools/composition_i12_review_lifecycle_addendum_v1.py:33-36; tools/test_composition_i12_review_lifecycle_addendum_v1.py:test_02 through test_15; passing original 66-test memory suite."
    },
    {
      "severity": "info",
      "claim": "All 16 addendum regression tests and all 66 original v2 memory-only tests pass with zero failures, errors or skips. No agents, web, trial calls, actual lifecycle events, gates, freezes, admission/progress artifacts or other files were created by this auditor; the only saved artifact is this first substantive independent review.",
      "evidence": "PYTHONDONTWRITEBYTECODE=1 PYTHONPATH=tools python3 -B -m unittest test_composition_i12_review_lifecycle_addendum_v1 -v:16 tests,exit0; PYTHONDONTWRITEBYTECODE=1 PYTHONPATH=tools python3 -B -m unittest test_composition_i12_runtime_v2 -q:66 tests,exit0; unchanged post-test declared-source SHA256 verification."
    }
  ],
